Hi,

something like this might work for you,

ggplot(mtcars, aes(x = wt, y = mpg)) +
geom_point() + geom_vline(xintercept = c(1.5, 3.5)) +
facet_grid(gear ~ .) +

scale_x_continuous(breaks=c(2:5,1.5,3.5), labels=c(2:5,"Event1","Event2"))

HTH,

baptiste

