Hi,

you could also use Grid,

p <- ggplot(df, aes(x, y, label = label)) +

 xlab("X label") + ylab(NULL)+ geom_point() +
 opts(title = "geom_point")

 grid.frame(name="gf")
 grid.pack("gf", ggplotGrob(p))
 grid.pack("gf", textGrob("a new subtitle"), side="bottom")

HTH,

baptiste

